# Snapshots describe this specific Mac in detail — serial number, platform
# UUID, every big file's full path, what's listening on which port. None of
# that belongs in a repo, and the whole point is that it's regenerable: run
# `node deckhand.mjs scan` and you have it back in 8 seconds.
data/

node_modules/
.DS_Store

# House convention: per-machine notes that aren't part of the project.
RUNNING.local.md
.env

# Personal service map, machine-specific paths. Never commit this.
deckhand.config.json

# Internal planning doc — names other projects and personal context.
PLAN.md
